  "description": "• Three-bedroom mid-terrace house in superb condition\n• Bright and spacious living room\n• Open-plan kitchen and dining area\n• Modern  bathroom\n• Private rear patio\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Off-street parking\n• Walking distance to Dundrum Town Centre\n• Approximately 5–10 minutes' walk to the Balally Luas stop\n• Close to Airfield Estate, schools, cafés, restaurants and local amenities\n• Easy access to the M50, N11 and Dublin City Centre\n\nEd Dempsey & Associates are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom mid-terrace Property to the market. Extending to approximately 92.5 sq.m., this bright and spacious unfurnished property offers well-proportioned accommodation, a private rear patio and an exceptional location in the heart of Dundrum, making it an ideal Property.\r\n \r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious living room, which flows through to a modern open-plan kitchen and dining area with direct access to the private rear patio, creating the perfect space for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n \r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a modern  bathroom, offering comfortable accommodation with an abundance of natural light throughout.\r\n \r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a low-maintenance private patio, ideal for outdoor dining and relaxing, while the front of the property offers off-street parking.\r\n \r\nThe location is second to none. Situated in the highly sought-after Taney Manor development, the property is within a 5–10 minute walk of Dundrum Town Centre, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, a cinema and leisure facilities. The nearby Balally Luas stop provides quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while Airfield Estate is also within easy walking distance. Residents are well catered for with an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, numerous Dublin Bus routes, and easy access to the M50 and N11. Marlay Park is just a short drive away, offering extensive parklands, walking trails and recreational facilities. \r\n \r\nThis superb home offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy modern living in one of South Dublin's most desirable residential locations.....",
